# NVIDIA Garak LLM Security Testing

This notebook runs NVIDIA Garak vulnerability testing against an Ollama LLM.

## Before Running

1. Make sure Ollama is installed and running.
2. Make sure the target model is installed.
3. Run `ollama list` to find the exact model name.
4. Connect this notebook to the machine where Ollama is running.
5. Run Cell 2 to install Garak.
6. In Cell 3, update `TARGET_MODEL` with the exact Ollama model name.
7. Run Cell 3.
8. Wait until the Garak scan completes.
9. Save the generated Garak reports for analysis.

Only perform security testing against systems you are authorized to test.
